    </task>
    <task id="Id_2b35b70a-b9f2-40b2-b883-8444d2c58df6" name="5.4.7 Complete appointed party's appointment documents">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Preencher os documentos do contrato, sendo importante que os documentos listados seja inclu&amp;iacute;do nos documentos de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. os requisitos de troca da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratada;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. o protocolo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o BIM (BEP) da equipe de entrega;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. o plano de entrega de tarefas (TIDP) da equipe de tarefa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;6. os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_59b4ea47-0be5-4fab-8bdf-76fb8db770ed</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_e4194597-9778-47d0-bdac-18e2cc46a211</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_3b08ec51-0170-4a7a-8254-46b88fad1e61" name="5.4.1 Confirm the delivery team's BEP">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A Empresa vencedora dever&amp;aacute; verificar o que estava no plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-contratual) e atualiz&amp;aacute;-lo se as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es n&amp;atilde;o refletirem mais a abordagem atual/planejada da equipe de entrega. Tamb&amp;eacute;m &amp;eacute; importante garantir que o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM atenda aos requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos de conte&amp;uacute;do da contratante e se encaixe em seu modelo (cl&amp;aacute;usulas 5.1.6 (b) e 5.2.4), se houver um.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; prov&amp;aacute;vel que um plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM evolua ao longo da vida da equipe de entrega &amp;agrave; medida que outras partes forem nomeadas. A Empresa &amp;eacute; respons&amp;aacute;vel por manter o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o BIM da equipe de entrega para que ele continue a representar a abordagem de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es da equipe. Como o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM &amp;eacute; um documento da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o (contrato), ele precisar&amp;aacute; estar sujeito a um processo de controle formal de mudan&amp;ccedil;as, com altera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es acordadas entre as partes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Uma recomenda&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o importante &amp;eacute; que o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM seja simples e conciso para que possa ser facilmente compreendido, implementado, assegurado e mantido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Resumo das atividades:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Fazer refer&amp;ecirc;ncia ao plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-contratual). Refletir sobre o conte&amp;uacute;do e qualquer feedback gerado pela contratante durane o processo de avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da proposta e alterar, conforme necess&amp;aacute;rio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Verifique o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Colabore com as partes designadas para garantir a concord&amp;acirc;ncia coletiva com a: 1. a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, 2. a matriz de responsabilidades, 3. o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e 4. os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos propostos para a produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Nesse momento, deve confirmar as propostas de TI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Envolver-se com a contratante para concordar com quaisquer adi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ou emendas ao padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto ou aos m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Atualizar a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e a matriz de responsabilidade de alto n&amp;iacute;vel, conforme necess&amp;aacute;rio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Enviar &amp;agrave; contratante para inclus&amp;atilde;o nos documentos de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_f1454008-0cda-400f-bc91-5ceca9d92295</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_e630a167-3083-4cc7-915f-8f1518ed6f2d</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_09c2c40e-8da5-4a2a-9c54-d2f51242ed14" name="5.4.2 Establish the delivery team's detailed responsability matrix">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Detalhar em mais alto n&amp;iacute;vel a Matriz de Responsabilidades que contemplar&amp;aacute;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Qual infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ser&amp;aacute; produzida;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Quando a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o tem que ser comaprtilhada e com quem;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Qual equipe de tarefa &amp;eacute; a respons&amp;aacute;vel por sua produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Ao preparar a matriz de responsabilidade detalhada, &amp;eacute; importante ter em mente que os planos de entrega de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de tarefas e o plano mestre de entrega de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o regidos pelas regras definidas pela matriz, mas estar&amp;atilde;o trabalhando em um n&amp;iacute;vel de cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A matriz de responsabilidade deve fazer refer&amp;ecirc;ncia aos requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es recebidos da contratante, para deixar claro como cada requisito est&amp;aacute; sendo atendido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_06fe570b-fff9-4eea-a2f8-5856d534481a</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_b7bcf499-cfa5-496f-baf6-406d238d9b04</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_7f6f0423-a795-45f2-895e-c8b5020aee2d">
        <dataOutput id="Id_44df81d1-5026-4c50-829d-048f73c8d2fd">
          <documentation />
          <dataState id="Id_37000d8f-6230-4958-bd85-68c2b42d022f" />
        </dataOutput>
        <inputSet id="Id_4ba6f1b6-9a19-4543-9f65-a7359e4f27e5" />
        <outputSet id="Id_3df2d8a5-f76a-4c12-bad0-c6c37de282ed">
          <dataOutputRefs>Id_44df81d1-5026-4c50-829d-048f73c8d2fd</dataOutputRefs>
        </outputSet>
      </ioSpecification>
      <dataOutputAssociation id="Id_48a45e69-bfcb-47a4-97a8-20b6e8b9e884">
        <documentation />
        <sourceRef>Id_44df81d1-5026-4c50-829d-048f73c8d2fd</sourceRef>
        <targetRef>Id_b3eb069a-78b7-48a9-a60e-0e100e4e37bb</targetRef>
      </dataOutputAssociation>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_d2849964-7a85-4bee-ab39-992adc6745e5" name="5.4.3 Establish the lead appointed party's exchange information requirements">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratada deve definir um conjunto de requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es (EIR) para cada designa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o que fizer, da mesma forma que a contratante faz (consulte ISO 19650-2, 5.2.1).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Cada EIR deve detalhar as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es exigidas pela contratada. Isso pode incluir aspectos relevantes do EIR da parte indicada, criando uma cascata em toda a cadeia de suprimentos. Esses s&amp;atilde;o requisitos detalhados e devem ser definidos com base no conceito do n&amp;iacute;vel de necessidade de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para garantir que todas as facetas das informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam capturadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Durante a entrega do projeto, os requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es fornecem o mecanismo para que a contratada autorize os modelos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. A cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.4.3 fornece detalhes passo a passo das atividades exigidas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_67f3ffb5-9c7b-4bbe-a59d-77e4ec8fe872</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_b97dcb53-c20f-4a05-8346-ef7f94f27846</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_7e35fb7e-7eaa-4f1d-908b-14d882d47173">
        <dataOutput id="Id_a8df5ffa-747c-4aa0-b813-54fd4fa69491">
